  <description>
    <p>Outputs 1 on any step where the input differs from the previous step.</p>
    <table border="1">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Module</td><td><code>nflow_blocks</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Library</td><td>Discrete</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Type</td><td><code>detectChange</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Label</td><td>Detect Change</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><img src="../../../../libraries/discrete/exports/detectChange.svg" align="middle"/></p>
    <p><b>Description</b></p>
    <p>Outputs 1 on any step whose input differs from its value at the previous step, else 0. <code>InitialCondition</code> seeds the value "before" the first step. Stateful (the previous input is held); element-wise over a vector input.</p>
    <p><b>Ports</b></p>
    <p><b>Input(s)</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Port</th><th>Role</th><th>Side</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Port_1</td><td>Numeric signal read by the block.</td><td>left</td><td>x=0, y=40</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Output(s)</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Port</th><th>Role</th><th>Side</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Port_1</td><td>Numeric signal produced by the block.</td><td>right</td><td>x=80, y=40</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Parameters</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Default value</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>InitialCondition</code></td><td>0</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Block Characteristics</b></p>
    <table border="1">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Block type</td><td>detectChange</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Family</td><td>Discrete</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Rendered size</td><td>80 x 80</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Phases</td><td>INIT, OUTPUT, UPDATE</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Internal state or history</td><td>yes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Signal data type</td><td>double numeric values</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><b>Algorithms</b></p>
    <ul>
      <li>OUTPUT: out = (u != prev) ? 1 : 0. UPDATE: prev = u.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><b>Equation or Rule</b></p>
    <latex>y_k = [\,u_k \neq u_{k-1}\,]</latex>
    <p><b>Extended Capabilities</b></p>
    <p>Code generation: supported for C and Rust.</p>
